     B_J, J = 3..12: [-1, 3, 7, 12, 18, 25, 33, 42, 52, 63]
  P7b B_J = (J^2 - J)/2 - 3 for J = 4..40: M(J, n, m) = B_J + n + m, polynomial, K-independent: pass 
  P7c control: no bound linear in J with slope 3 (B_24 > 72): pass B_24 = 273
